          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũla ũkakiita kimba kya mũndũ o na wĩva akeethĩwa e mũvuku matukũ mũonza: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.31.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mot 31.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ũsu akethesya namo mũthenya wa katatũ, na mũthenya wa mũonza akeethĩwa e mũtheu: ĩndĩ ethĩwa ndeĩthesya mũthenya wa katatũ, ĩndĩ mũthenya wa mũonza ndakethĩwa e mũtheu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O ũla ũkakiita kimba, o mwĩĩ wa mũndũ ũla ũkw’ĩte, nake ndeĩthesya mwene, nũvukasya wĩkalo wa Yeova; na mũndũ ũsu akavetwa kuma nthĩnĩ wa Isilaeli: nũndũ manzĩ asu ma kũthesya ũvuku matyaaminzangĩw’a ĩũlũ wake, akeethĩwa e mũvuku; ũvuku wake ũkeethĩwa o ĩũlũ wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.15.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ali 15.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.22.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
