        {
          "text": "na mũndũ mũtheu akamũminzangĩĩsye ũsu mũvuku mũthenya wa katatũ, na mũthenya wa mũonza: na mũthenya wa mũonza akamũthesya; nake akathambya ngũa syake, ina kũthamba manzĩnĩ, na akeethĩwa e mũtheu wĩoo. ",
